%N A051460 Number of asymmetric types of Boolean functions of n variables under action of symmetric group.
%C A051460 For n = 5,...,12 the terms were computed by Möbius inversion over the subgroup lattice of S_n, reduced to conjugacy classes of subgroups using tables of marks. - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Aug 24 2026
%H A051460 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A051460/b051460.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..12</a>
%H A051460 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A051460/a051460.pdf">Computational evaluation of A051460</a>
%H A051460 <a href="/index/Bo#Boolean">Index entries for sequences related to Boolean functions</a>
%F A051460 a(n) = (1/n!)*Sum_{K <= S_n} mu(E,K)*2^c(K*), where E is the trivial subgroup, mu is the Möbius function of the subgroup lattice of S_n, and c(K*) is the number of K-orbits on {0,1}^n. - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Aug 24 2026
%Y A051460 Cf. A003180 (number of equivalence classes of Boolean functions of n variables under the action of S_n).
%K A051460 hard,nonn,changed
%O A051460 1,1
%A A051460 _Vladeta Jovovic_
%E A051460 a(5)-a(12) computed by _Vladeta Jovovic_, Aug 24 2026
